msgid "Warm resources at startup"
msgstr "Warm resources at startup"


msgid "Reads model, skeleton and texture files from resource folders registered by the game and enabled mods into the RAM cache in the background, starting in the main menu. Model and skeleton files are read before textures. Stops at the RAM limit instead of cycling through the whole library. Game requests take priority. Requires the resource RAM cache. Does not create NPCs or prepare model geometry. The progress text reports scanning and processed files, including skipped files."
msgstr "Reads model, skeleton and texture files from resource folders registered by the game and enabled mods into the RAM cache in the background, starting in the main menu. Model and skeleton files are read before textures. Stops at the RAM limit instead of cycling through the whole library. Game requests take priority. Requires the resource RAM cache. Does not create NPCs or prepare model geometry. The progress text reports scanning and processed files, including skipped files."


