msgstr "processed"


msgid "skipped"
msgstr "skipped"


msgid "Keep loaded model geometry in VRAM"
msgstr "Keep loaded model geometry in VRAM"


msgid "Keeps supported model geometry already loaded by the game for faster revisits. Does not load unseen models or create NPCs. Shares the VRAM limit with prepared terrain and releases cached references under memory pressure. Requires the resource RAM cache. Unsupported models use normal loading."
msgstr "Keeps supported model geometry already loaded by the game for faster revisits. Does not load unseen models or create NPCs. Shares the VRAM limit with prepared terrain and releases cached references under memory pressure. Requires the resource RAM cache. Unsupported models use normal loading."


msgid "Shared limit for retained model geometry, loaded textures and prepared terrain, not a preallocation. The actual graphics memory budget takes priority. Lower this on GPUs with little free memory."
msgstr "Shared limit for retained model geometry, loaded textures and prepared terrain, not a preallocation. The actual graphics memory budget takes priority. Lower this on GPUs with little free memory."


