msgid "Keep loaded textures in VRAM"
msgstr "Keep loaded textures in VRAM"


msgid "Keeps supported textures already loaded by the game for faster revisits. Shares the VRAM limit with model geometry and prepared terrain, and releases cached references under memory pressure. Does not preload unseen textures. Requires the RAM resource cache. Generated and render-target textures use normal loading."
msgstr "Keeps supported textures already loaded by the game for faster revisits. Shares the VRAM limit with model geometry and prepared terrain, and releases cached references under memory pressure. Does not preload unseen textures. Requires the RAM resource cache. Generated and render-target textures use normal loading."


