#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Skip empty squad request work"
msgstr "Skip empty squad request work"

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Avoids temporary memory allocation when a squad has no timed requests. Active requests, jobs, AI and squad update frequency remain unchanged. Available on supported Steam builds; other builds retain normal behavior."
msgstr "Avoids temporary memory allocation when a squad has no timed requests. Active requests, jobs, AI and squad update frequency remain unchanged. Available on supported Steam builds; other builds retain normal behavior."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Prepare NPC skeleton storage"
msgstr "Prepare NPC skeleton storage"

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Reduces repeated memory allocations while the game builds a new NPC skeleton. Bone creation, appearance, animations and loading order stay native. Takes effect for newly loaded skeleton instances on supported engine builds."
msgstr "Reduces repeated memory allocations while the game builds a new NPC skeleton. Bone creation, appearance, animations and loading order stay native. Takes effect for newly loaded skeleton instances on supported engine builds."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Prepare model storage"
msgstr "Prepare model storage"

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Reduces repeated small memory allocations while the game copies model parts and shape data. Geometry, appearance, materials, animation and loading order stay unchanged. Applies to new model copies on supported engine builds."
msgstr "Reduces repeated small memory allocations while the game copies model parts and shape data. Geometry, appearance, materials, animation and loading order stay unchanged. Applies to new model copies on supported engine builds."

msgid "Reuse temporary body shape data"
msgstr "Reuse temporary body shape data"

msgid "Reduces temporary copying of shape data while the game builds a character's appearance. Each character keeps its own model and appearance. Does not change equipment, animation, rendering or spawn order. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Reduces temporary copying of shape data while the game builds a character's appearance. Each character keeps its own model and appearance. Does not change equipment, animation, rendering or spawn order. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Prepare copied material storage"
msgstr "Prepare copied material storage"

msgid "Reduces repeated small memory allocations when the game copies materials for models and equipment. Texture layers, colours, shaders and independent material copies stay native. Applies to newly copied materials on supported engine builds."
msgstr "Reduces repeated small memory allocations when the game copies materials for models and equipment. Texture layers, colours, shaders and independent material copies stay native. Applies to newly copied materials on supported engine builds."

msgid "Batch save file reads"
msgstr "Batch save file reads"

msgid "Uses a larger buffer for eligible save files and groups consecutive fields already in the buffer. Save format and values stay unchanged. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Uses a larger buffer for eligible save files and groups consecutive fields already in the buffer. Save format and values stay unchanged. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Transfer temporary save strings"
msgstr "Transfer temporary save strings"

msgid "Reduces copying of temporary state identifiers and long string or file fields while parsing saved objects. Eligible complete lists and owned field values transfer without an extra copy. Save format, values and loading order stay native. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Reduces copying of temporary state identifiers and long string or file fields while parsing saved objects. Eligible complete lists and owned field values transfer without an extra copy. Save format, values and loading order stay native. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Speed up equipment property reads"
msgstr "Speed up equipment property reads"

msgid "Reduces repeated CPU work when the game reads equipment properties during appearance setup. Values, missing-property defaults and equipment selection stay native. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Reduces repeated CPU work when the game reads equipment properties during appearance setup. Values, missing-property defaults and equipment selection stay native. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Reuse saved object lookups"
msgstr "Reuse saved object lookups"

msgid "Avoids searching the same object tree twice while restoring saved objects. Native object construction, insertion, values and loading order are preserved. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Avoids searching the same object tree twice while restoring saved objects. Native object construction, insertion, values and loading order are preserved. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Avoid repeated animation state searches"
msgstr "Avoid repeated animation state searches"

msgid "Reduces repeated CPU searches when preparing animation states for models. Eligible new states use native insertion at the current end of the table; other cases keep normal lookup. State creation, animation values and native locking are preserved. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Reduces repeated CPU searches when preparing animation states for models. Eligible new states use native insertion at the current end of the table; other cases keep normal lookup. State creation, animation values and native locking are preserved. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Reuse held animation lock"
msgstr "Reuse held animation lock"

msgid "Reduces repeated lock operations while creating model animation states. Only an already owned native lock is reused; other callers keep normal synchronization. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Reduces repeated lock operations while creating model animation states. Only an already owned native lock is reused; other callers keep normal synchronization. Supported engine builds only."

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Skip discarded save field keys"
msgstr "Skip discarded save field keys"

msgid "Avoids constructing temporary field names that the save parser would immediately discard. Permission checks, final field names, values and loading order stay native. Supported engine builds only."
msgstr "Avoids constructing temporary field names that the save parser would immediately discard. Permission checks, final field names, values and loading order stay native. Supported engine builds only."


#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Speed up model preparation"
msgstr "Speed up model preparation"

#: src/fixes/fixes_config.cpp
msgid "Speeds up skeletal weights and triangle connectivity when loading models. Bone weights, assignment order and geometry stay the same. Applies to newly loaded models on supported engine builds."
msgstr "Speeds up skeletal weights and triangle connectivity when loading models. Bone weights, assignment order and geometry stay the same. Applies to newly loaded models on supported engine builds."

msgid "Pathing repairs itself"
msgstr "Pathing repairs itself"

msgid "Runs native Ctrl+Shift+F11 building repair and full exterior/interior navmesh generation once per visited zone after each save load. Waits for idle loading and physics, with spaced requests. Building repair covers all active zones, as in KenshiQOL. Requires navmesh caching. Off by default."
msgstr "Runs native Ctrl+Shift+F11 building repair and full exterior/interior navmesh generation once per visited zone after each save load. Waits for idle loading and physics, with spaced requests. Building repair covers all active zones, as in KenshiQOL. Requires navmesh caching. Off by default."
